3}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-25}\\frac{1}{{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u. \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{\\int }_{a}^{-25}{u}^{-2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{[-{u}^{-1}]}_{a}^{-25} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{[\\frac{1}{u}]}_{a}^{-25} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }[\\frac{1}{(-25)}-\\frac{1}{a}] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}(-\\frac{1}{25}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{75}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299193 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299194 13194139534618 true] [17592186299193 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299195 13194139534618 true] [17592186299193 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299196 13194139534618 true] [17592186299193 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299197 13194139534618 true] [17592186299193 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299198 13194139534618 true] [17592186299193 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534618 true] [17592186299193 1041 "selection" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299193 1104 #edb/ref 17592186299197 13194139534618 true] [17592186299193 1110 #uuid "0622968c-8977-5e11-8cb4-e1476c21bc1b" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299194 1034 "\\frac{1}{15}" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299194 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534618 true] [17592186299194 1111 #uuid "fc9c1ece-6da2-541b-96eb-067c970a478c" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299195 1034 "The integral diverges" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299195 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534618 true] [17592186299195 1111 #uuid "d93c1dd1-fd9c-530c-b462-be1229e94db8" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299196 1034 "\\frac{3}{25}" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299196 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534618 true] [17592186299196 1111 #uuid "570b97b6-7767-55ff-8a9d-06fabec17b9f" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299197 1034 "\\frac{1}{75}" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299197 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534618 true] [17592186299197 1111 #uuid "0c511ab6-1746-5ad7-8b83-2f3d5e297c09" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299198 1034 "\\frac{1}{25}" 1319413953461