ly, we proceed by setting the upper bound equal to some parameter $a,$ integrating as usual, and then taking the limit as $a\\to \\infty .$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }\\frac{8{z}^{3}}{{({z}^{4}+1)}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}z & =2{\\int }_{2}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{{u}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{2}^{\\infty }{u}^{-4}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =2{lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{2}^{a}{u}^{-4}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =2{lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{[-\\frac{1}{3}{u}^{-3}]}_{2}^{a} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}{lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{[\\frac{1}{{u}^{3}}]}_{2}^{a} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}{lim}_{a\\to \\infty }(\\frac{1}{{a}^{3}}-\\frac{1}{8}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}(0-\\frac{1}{8}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299207 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299208 13194139534618 true] [17592186299207 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299209 13194139534618 true] [17592186299207 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299210 13194139534618 true] [17592186299207 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299211 13194139534618 true] [17592186299207 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299212 13194139534618 true] [17592186299207 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534618 true] [17592186299207 1041 "selection" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299207 1104 #edb/ref 17592186299210 13194139534618 true] [17592186299207 1110 #uuid "da8fb055-0d15-5c88-ace6-1b413b879ba8" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299208 1034 "\\frac{5}{6}" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299208 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534618 true] [17592186299208 1111 #uuid "18727bbe-e2e5-52a9-9f54-2fa8e7a2d0b4" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299209 1034 "\\frac{1}{6}" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299209 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534618 true] [17592186299209 1111 #uuid "b88dd8c5-01cb-53a8-b29e-e205e94129ff" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299210 1034 "\\frac{1}{12}" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299210 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534618 true] [17592186299210 1111 #uuid "1d15d8a5-9581-588a-8ca0-22f32e4dadb6" 13194139534618 true] [17592186299211 1034 "\\f